  #   Important samajh le (Roman Hindi me)
  #     .idea/ → IntelliJ ka local config hota hai (team ke liye useless)
  #     target/ / build/ → compiled files (Git me nahi daalte)
  #     .env → sensitive data (password, DB URL, API keys)
  #     node_modules/ → huge size, kabhi push nahi karna

